## Bundled third-party skills

`bundled/skills/` contains third-party skill packages redistributed for convenience.
Each retains its own licence, stated in the upstream package where one is present:

| Skill | Upstream | Licence |
|---|---|---|
| `ai-ui-ux-motion-engine` | github.com/OpaceDigitalAgency/skills | see package |
| `awwwards-animations` | github.com/devmartinese/awwwards-animations-skill | see package |
| `cinematic-gsap-lenis-motion-system` | github.com/mengto/skills | see package |
| `gsap-core`, `gsap-scrolltrigger`, `gsap-react` | github.com/greensock/gsap-skills | see package |
| `vercel-react-best-practices` | github.com/vercel-labs/agent-skills | see package |
| `scroll-craft` | github.com/nateherkai/scroll-craft | MIT |
| `stripe-best-practices` | github.com/stripe/ai | see package |
| `claude-security` | github.com/anthropics/claude-plugins-official | see package |
| `seo-*` | github.com/every-app/open-seo | see package |
| `hyperframes-*`, `media-use`, `general-video`, … | github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes | Apache-2.0 |
| `remotion-*` | github.com/remotion-dev/skills | see package |
| `ui-ux-pro-max` | github.com/nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill | see package |

Skills whose upstream is not public are redistributed as-is from the author's working copy.
Verify licence terms before redistribution outside your own use.